'''Magician''' (Japanese: '''マジシャン''') is one of the [[Ghost Master]]s located in the [[Sealed Fort]], located on [[GR Island]] in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game 2: The Invasion of Team GR!]] Magician can be found in the second of the nine statues in the main room. Players who defeat Magician will obtain a Present Pack, which can consist of any card that can be found in a booster pack in the game.

==Immortal Pokémon Deck==
'''Immortal Pokémon Deck''' (Japanese: '''ふじみのポケモンデッキ''') is the deck played by Magician. The deck features mostly {{e|Psychic}} Pokémon and includes numerous cards designed to prevent damage or leave the battle when weakened to prevent the claim of prize cards.

